{
 "name": "Animate Dead — firing its trigger returns the graveyard card it is on, under your control, and may be on only that creature",
 "notes": "Memory: project_animate_dead_graveyard_card_picker_2026-11-16. Animate Dead is put on Player 2's Serra Angel in the graveyard and its trigger fired. The fired 'if it's on the battlefield, it loses \"enchant creature card in a graveyard\" and gains \"…\"' was a pick of a creature (the 'it' guessed as 'target creature'); it is now the Aura's own (rewritten 'This enchantment loses … . This enchantment gains …' in _addAbilityPseudo). 'Return enchanted creature card to the battlefield under your control' moves the card (Battlefield._returnGraveyardEnchanted): Serra Angel is Player 1's, 3/4 with -1/-0, and the picker lists only Serra Angel ('enchant creature put onto the battlefield with this Aura': _returnedPermId), not Grizzly Bears.",
